<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020"><title>Cartman | Deployment History</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/modules/deployment-workflows.css">
<script src="/static/js/modules/standalone-page.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/core/module-definitions.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/modules/standalone-navigation.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/modules/deployment-demo-store.js" defer></script>
<script src="/static/js/modules/deployment-workflows.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body data-deployment-page="history">
<header class="topbar"><div class="brand-area"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-logo">C</span><span>CARTMAN</span></a></div>
<div class="top-actions"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;color:#a5b4fc">DEMO PREVIEW</span><a class="secondary-button" href="/">&#8592; Dashboard</a></div></header>
<main class="dw-page">
<div class="dw-header"><div><div class="dw-eyebrow">CARTMAN WORKSPACE / SOFTWARE &amp; DEPLOYMENT</div><h1>Deployment History</h1><p>Review recorded rollout outcomes and inspect what happened across the demo session.</p></div>
<div class="dw-actions"><a class="dw-btn" href="/pages/deployment-jobs/">View jobs →</a><button class="dw-btn dw-btn-primary" id="dw-export">Export history ↗</button></div></div>
<div class="dw-notice"><span class="dw-notice-icon">i</span><div><strong>Demo environment</strong><p>Session-only sample data. No API requests, installations, or remote endpoint actions.</p></div></div>
<section class="dw-stats">
<article class="dw-stat"><span class="dw-stat-label">Total records</span><strong id="dw-total">—</strong><small>Visible in this demo view</small></article>
<article class="dw-stat"><span class="dw-stat-label">Running</span><strong id="dw-running">—</strong><small>Simulated active jobs</small></article>
<article class="dw-stat"><span class="dw-stat-label">Queued</span><strong id="dw-queued">—</strong><small>Waiting in demo queue</small></article>
<article class="dw-stat"><span class="dw-stat-label">Failed</span><strong id="dw-failed">—</strong><small>Needs review in the demo</small></article>
</section><section class="dw-panel">
<div class="dw-panel-head"><div><div class="dw-eyebrow">AUDIT TRAIL · DEMO</div><h2>Deployment activity history</h2><p>Search previous rollout activity and inspect each record's current demo status.</p></div><span class="dw-count" id="dw-count">Loading records</span></div>
<div class="dw-filters"><input class="dw-input dw-search" id="dw-search" type="search" placeholder="Search deployment, target, version or ID..." aria-label="Search records">
<select class="dw-select" id="dw-status" aria-label="Filter by status"><option value="all">All statuses</option><option>Running</option><option>Queued</option><option>Completed</option><option>Failed</option><option>Draft</option></select>
<button class="dw-btn" id="dw-reset">Reset filters</button></div>
<div class="dw-table-wrap" id="dw-table-wrap"><table class="dw-table"><thead><tr>
<th><button class="dw-btn" data-dw-sort="name">Deployment ↕</button></th>
<th>Target group</th><th>Version</th><th><button class="dw-btn" data-dw-sort="progress">Progress ↕</button></th>
<th><button class="dw-btn" data-dw-sort="status">Status ↕</button></th><th>Actions</th>
</tr></thead><tbody id="dw-rows"></tbody></table></div>
<div class="dw-empty" id="dw-empty" hidden><strong>No matching records</strong>Change the search term or clear your filters.</div>
<div class="dw-table-foot"><span>Demo records only</span><span>No live deployment activity</span></div>
</section><footer class="dw-footer"><span>Cartman Infrastructure Management</span><span>Deployment workspace · UI Preview</span></footer>
<div class="dw-toast" id="dw-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
<div class="dw-modal-backdrop" id="dw-detail-modal" hidden><section class="dw-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dw-detail-title">
<div class="dw-modal-head"><div><div class="dw-eyebrow">RECORD DETAILS</div><h2 id="dw-detail-title">Deployment details</h2></div><button class="dw-close" data-dw-close="dw-detail-modal" aria-label="Close">×</button></div>
<div class="dw-modal-body" id="dw-detail-body"></div><div class="dw-modal-foot"><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#8b95a7)">Demo data only</span><button class="dw-btn dw-btn-primary" data-dw-close="dw-detail-modal">Done</button></div>
</section></div>
</main></body></html>